  "description": "Hello, viewers! Welcome to the world of monsters, where certain people are awakened with specific characteristics and can become hunters. But our MC, Si-U, was awakened with absolutely no characteristics. How useless! Just when he'd lost hope... Ding! “Subscribe to gods' channels and get god-like characteristics.” Now, with the skills of the gods, Si-U, a used-to-be nobody, is making his name heard throughout hunter society. Like and subscribe to see if he’ll be able to pull this off! \n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)",
